-- CTP: damages and limits (Civil Liability Act Part 8)
-- HYPOTHETICAL CPI: September 2001 75.0 and September 2025 141.0 (1.88); March 2013 100.0 and March 2025 130.0 (1.30).
-- =====================================================================================================================

-- Prescribed minimum: 2 750 x 1.88 = 5 170; maximum: 2 200 000 x 1.88 = 4 136 000. With 141.3: 1.884, so 5 181, to
-- the nearest $10 5 180, and 4 144 800.
